  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Sustainable and Equitable Fiscal Policies</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a Polticas Fiscales Sostenibles y Equitativas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es promover la equidad y la sostenibilidad fiscal y ambiental de largo plazo. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) incrementar la equidad del sistema tributario; (ii) incrementar la efectividad del sistema tributario; y (iii) contribuir a la estrategia nacional ambiental y de descarbonizacin de la economa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to promote equity and long-term fiscal and environmental sustainability. The specific objectives are: (i) increase the equity of the tax system; (ii) increase the efficiency of the tax system; and (iii) contribute to the national environmental and decarbonization strategy. The general objective is to promote equity and long-term fiscal and environmental sustainability. The specific objectives are: (i) increase the equity of the tax system; (ii) increase the efficiency of the tax system; and (iii) contribute to the national environmental and decarbonization strategy of the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
